  "title": "Sweet Sesame Mahi Mahi",
  "description": "Mahi mahi fillets are coated with sesame seeds before being pan-fried in this recipe, which also makes a simple pineapple salsa for serving with the cooked fish.",
  "authors": [
    "GIGI9801"
  ],
